            "es": "EN FORMA HUMANA",
            "en": "IN HUMAN FORM"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 560
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "Above all the heavens is the holy and perfect Mother-Father.",
          "es": "Sobre todos los cielos está la santa y perfecta Madre-Padre."
        },
        {
          "en": "She is the first Forethought, the image of the Invisible Spirit, the pure light.",
          "es": "Ella es la primera Previsión, la imagen del Espíritu Invisible, la luz pura."
        },
        {
          "en": "She is Barbelo, the First Human.",
          "es": "Ella es Barbelo, el Primer Humano."
        },
        {
          "en": "And now the First Human showed a likeness, in the shape of a human.",
          "es": "Y ahora el Primer Humano mostró una semejanza, con forma humana."
        }
      ]
