        {
          "en": 1.1,
          "texto": {
            "es": "\"HAGAMOS UN HOMBRE\"",
            "en": "\"LET US CREATE A MAN\""
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 200,
          "hasta": 2.5
        },
        {
          "en": 2.6,
          "texto": {
            "es": "\"QUE SEA UNA LUZ PARA NOSOTROS\"",
            "en": "\"A LIGHT FOR US\""
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 200
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "Then Yaldabaoth spoke to the authorities who served him.",
          "es": "Entonces Yaldabaoth les habló a las autoridades que lo servían."
        },
        {
          "en": "He said, \"Come, let us create a man after the image of God and after our likeness.\"",
          "es": "Dijo: \"Vengan, hagamos un hombre a imagen de Dios y a nuestra semejanza\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "\"So that his image may become a light for us.\"",
          "es": "\"Para que su imagen sea una luz para nosotros\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "And each of them gave from his own power, to make him.",
          "es": "Y cada uno de ellos dio de su propio poder, para hacerlo."
        }
      ]
    },
