        },
        {
          "en": 4.1,
          "texto": {
            "es": "\"LLAMÉMOSLO ADÁN\"",
            "en": "\"LET US CALL HIM ADAM\""
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 180
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "So they made him, each with his own power, from the features they had been given.",
          "es": "Así lo hicieron, cada uno con su propio poder, con los rasgos que les habían dado."
        },
        {
          "en": "Each authority gave one feature, from the image he had seen.",
          "es": "Cada autoridad dio un rasgo, de la imagen que había visto."
        },
        {
          "en": "They made a being like the first and perfect Human.",
          "es": "Hicieron un ser como el primer y perfecto Humano."
        },
        {
          "en": "It was not yet a body of earth. It was a body made of soul.",
          "es": "Todavía no era un cuerpo de tierra. Era un cuerpo hecho de alma."
        },
        {
          "en": "And they said, \"Let us call him Adam, so that his name may become a power of light for us.\"",
          "es": "Y dijeron: \"Llamémoslo Adán, para que su nombre sea un poder de luz para nosotros\"."
        }
      ]
